    "created_at": "2017-04-09T14:07:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-09T14:07:39Z",
    "body": "> Is this how we expose link relation keywords in general?\r\n\r\nWe've never had need to expose any others that I'm aware of, because I think either we've not yet had other cases of specs that need to refer back to the definition of a link relation type in HTML in the way that we need for the Service Workers spec, or else any specs that have needed to do it have just manually done it with a hardcoded absolute URL the HTML-spec anchor (rather than using the Bikeshed cross-reference machinery to create the link).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
