    "created_at": "2017-04-10T20:34:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-10T20:36:37Z",
    "body": "In IRC @tabatkins says that this should be `data-dfn-for=\"link/rel\" data-dfn-type=\"attr-value\"` (then the data-lt should not be necessary).\r\n\r\nAnd then in Bikeshed-using specs you can refer to it as `<{link/rel/serviceworker}>`",
